Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:12.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is another historic night for Novak Djokovic,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇又一个历史之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:16.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he is the champion for a record seventh time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第七次夺冠 创下纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:25.71,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}座年终总决赛冠军 历史最多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:29.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}年后 {\fs78}39{\fs68}岁的他 站在了门外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:32.15,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳伤停报销 入围线降到第九
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:33.97,TL,,0,0,0,,坐在门里最后一个位置的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.45,TL,,0,0,0,,是{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.65,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3159{\fs68}分 德约 差{\fs78}319{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.34,TL,,0,0,0,,年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.59,TL,,0,0,0,,一年只请积分最高的{\fs78}8{\fs68}个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:46.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2008{\fs68}年 上海 {\fs78}21{\fs68}岁的他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:48.10,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次站上最高处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:53.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:01:05.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it was a very accomplished performance this afternoon,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天下午打得非常老练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:11.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}faltered ever so slightly in that second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N只在第二盘稍微晃了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:15.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2012{\fs68}到{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年 伦敦四连冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:18.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}年之后 {\fs78}2022{\fs68}年 都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:27.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Djokovic is the champion in Turin,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇在都灵夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:31.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it is a sixth Nitto ATP Finals title for the Serb.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他第六个年终总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}35{\fs68}岁 他又一次站上最高处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.63,0:01:38.11,TL,,0,0,0,,第六座 追平了费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:42.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年 第七座
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.07,0:01:44.32,TL,,0,0,0,,比费德勒多一座 历史第一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:45.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}36{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:48.49,TL,,0,0,0,,他把最年长冠军的纪录又刷新了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.32,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}2007{\fs68}年起 {\fs78}19{\fs68}个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.07,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}18{\fs68}次拿到这张门票
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:57.38,TL,,0,0,0,,只缺了肘伤的{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:02:00.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68}次 和费德勒并列历史最多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:02.11,TL,,0,0,0,,可{\fs78}2024{\fs68} {\fs78}2025{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:04.28,TL,,0,0,0,,他入围了 又都退了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:06.79,TL,,0,0,0,,今年 他想再回去一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:13.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}个星期前在北京 他{\fs78}34{\fs68}战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:15.30,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯第{\fs78}102{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.11,TL,,0,0,0,,只是这一冠赢得不痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.92,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 对手被取消了资格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:24.01,TL,,0,0,0,,可他的球 一点没打折扣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:25.29,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛第一盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:28.08,TL,,0,0,0,,他的发球局 被逼到了破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:43.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, you are kidding me!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:46.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How has he made that?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球他是怎么救回来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.38,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘刚开局 德米纳尔大腿受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.22,TL,,0,0,0,,只打了一局就退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:55.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}39{\fs68}岁夺冠 比他年纪更大的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:56.75,TL,,0,0,0,,要追到{\fs78}1977{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:59.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}43{\fs68}岁的罗斯沃尔在香港登顶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:07.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I know that when I'm feeling well and striking the ball well, I can still compete at the highest level.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N状态对了 我还能在最高水平竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:12.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This week has been an evidence to that. To be honest, I'm very proud.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周证明了这点 说实话我很骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:15.14,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}天后 上海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:18.69,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮 胡尔卡奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.19,TL,,0,0,0,,此前{\fs78}8{\fs68}次交手 德约全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:25.16,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 一盘都没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:28.82,TL,,0,0,0,,上海四冠王 这回只带走{\fs78}10{\fs68}个积分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:40.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Hurkacz takes out Djokovic for the first time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N胡尔卡奇第一次赢了德约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First time in nine meetings.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N九次交手 这是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:47.07,TL,,0,0,0,,同一个上海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:49.74,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的霍达尔一路打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:52.25,TL,,0,0,0,,他先赢一盘 离冠军只差两分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.85,TL,,0,0,0,,还是被达维多维奇 福基纳逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:57.39,TL,,0,0,0,,可这个亚军 值{\fs78}650{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:03:59.40,TL,,0,0,0,,北京之后还坐在门里的德约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.60,TL,,0,0,0,,就这样被挤到了门外
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.89,TL,,0,0,0,,其实这一整年 都不像他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:08.85,TL,,0,0,0,,一月澳网决赛 他先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:10.81,TL,,0,0,0,,还是输给了阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:12.26,TL,,0,0,0,,墨尔本{\fs78}11{\fs68}次进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.93,TL,,0,0,0,,前{\fs78}10{\fs68}次全胜 这是第一次输
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:24.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He is congratulated by the greatest of all time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N史上最伟大的人 向他道贺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月美网 第一轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:31.59,TL,,0,0,0,,上次大满贯首轮输球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:33.22,TL,,0,0,0,,还是{\fs78}2006{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:35.74,TL,,0,0,0,,世界排名 掉到了第{\fs78}12{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:40.06,TL,,0,0,0,,上海输完 他说接下来只打巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}16{\fs68}号 他改了主意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.96,TL,,0,0,0,,接下巴塞尔的外卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.03,TL,,0,0,0,,那是他{\fs78}15{\fs68}年没去过的赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:49.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年 就在费德勒的家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:51.71,TL,,0,0,0,,他在决赛赢了费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:58.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was a pretty average match, to be perfectly honest,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说实话 这场打得一般
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:01.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but Novak Djokovic was able to get the job done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但德约科维奇把比赛拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:07.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's the Serb who rains on Roger's parade,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位塞尔维亚人搅了罗杰的局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:12.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}finally putting an end to Federer's stronghold at this event.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N终结了费德勒在这里的统治
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:17.05,TL,,0,0,0,,霍达尔 也在巴塞尔的签表里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:18.50,TL,,0,0,0,,追的人和被追的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.63,TL,,0,0,0,,同一周 同一块场地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:22.11,TL,,0,0,0,,巴塞尔冠军{\fs78}500{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:24.67,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一站巴黎 {\fs78}1000{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:28.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}座奖杯 没有一张门票是送的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:30.73,TL,,0,0,0,,门票不认名字 只认积分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:33.43,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}8{\fs68}号巴黎落幕 {\fs78}39{\fs68}岁的他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.84,TL,,0,0,0,,还能不能拿到第{\fs78}19{\fs68}张？
